<title>USA: Service Merchandise Co Inc Q4 net eased.</title>
<headline>Service Merchandise Co Inc Q4 net eased.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				  Quarter		  Year</p>
<p>			     1996   1995 (A)	1996    1995 (A)</p>
<p> Net sales	  $1,641,076 $1,686,490 $3,955,016 $4,018,525</p>
<p>  % decrease	    (2.7%)		    (1.6%)</p>
<p>Comparable store net</p>
<p>   sales decrease     (2.8%)		    (1.9%)</p>
<p>Earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization (C)</p>
<p>			   161,111    167,841    196,217    222,073</p>
<p>  % of net sales	  9.8%	10.0%	 5.0%	 5.5%</p>
<p> Net earnings	   78,191     81,025     39,330     50,325</p>
<p>  % of net sales	  4.8%	 4.8%	 1.0%	 1.3%</p>
<p>Average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding (B)    100,373    101,826    100,326    101,457</p>
<p> Per common share:	0.78	 0.80	 0.39	 0.50</p>
<p>(A) Certain amounts have been reclassified to conform to the current year's presentation.</p>
<p>(B) 1996 and 1995 per share data and number of shares include 512 and 515 shares of restricted stock, respectively.</p>
<p>(C) EBITDA consists of net earnings before interest, income taxes, depreciation and amortization and other non-cash charges and credits.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
